    "advice_t1_title": "Progressive overload is the key",
    "advice_t1_body": "Muscles adapt to stress. Small, steady increases in weight, reps, or time-under-tension drive real progress. Add a little each week — your body will follow.",
    "advice_t2_title": "Master the basics first",
    "advice_t2_body": "Squat, hinge, push, pull, carry. Most progress comes from doing a few fundamental movements very well. Drill clean technique before chasing fancier variations.",
