    "advice_m2_body": "What gets measured gets managed. A simple log of sessions, sleep, and mood reveals patterns and gives your coach real context to work with.",
    "advice_m3_title": "Set process goals, not just outcomes",
    "advice_m3_body": "Outcomes (lose 5 kg, run a 5k) are the direction. Process goals (3 sessions per week, 7 hours sleep) are what you actually control. Focus there.",
